## Stats & Observability

### State File: `.instar/state/evolution/learning-extractor.json`

```typescript
interface LearningExtractorState {
  stats: {
    totalMessagesIngested: number;
    totalBatchesAnalyzed: number;
    totalFindingsGenerated: number;
    findingsByType: { learning: number; proposal: number; gap: number };
    findingsBySeverity: { high: number; medium: number; low: number };
    lastAnalysisAt: string | null;
    avgFindingsPerBatch: number;
    messagesSkipped: number;       // Filtered out (too short, excluded channel)
    analysesThrottled: number;     // Hit rate limit
  };
  recentFindings: Finding[];        // Last 20, for debugging
}
```

### API Endpoint

```
GET /learning-extractor/status
```

Returns stats + recent findings. Registered in routes.ts alongside `/evolution`.

