## Wiring: Server Startup

In `src/server/InstarServer.ts` (or wherever SendGateway is instantiated):

```typescript
// After SendGateway and EvolutionManager are created:
if (config.learningExtractor?.enabled) {
  const extractor = new LearningExtractor(
    { ...defaults, ...config.learningExtractor },
    this.evolutionManager,
    this.intelligenceProvider,
  );

  this.sendGateway.setPostReviewCallback((entry) => extractor.ingest(entry));

  // Register status endpoint
  this.registerRoute('GET', '/learning-extractor/status', () => extractor.getStatus());
}
```

